OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBands of rain will move across
OL,6,FEngland and Wales today, gradually
OL,7,Fclearing the warm and humid air and
OL,8,Fturning fresher. Sunshine and heavy
OL,9,Fscattered showers in the north with
OL,10,Fblustery winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers continuing tonight
OL,13,Facross the north and west, with
OL,14,Fthunderstorms at times. Dry elsewhere
OL,15,Fwith clear spells. Staying breezy, and
OL,16,Ffeeling fresher than recent nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
