OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FDry for many on Wednesday
OL,6,Fwith partly cloudy skies and some
OL,7,Fbright spells. Scattered showers are
OL,8,Fpossible where the cloud thickens. A
OL,9,Fbreezy and cool feeling day for many.
